1
00:00:29,379 --> 00:00:30,539
What's going on here?

2
00:00:31,539 --> 00:00:33,240
Aren't these my things?

3
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:33,979
Mengmeng!

4
00:00:34,359 --> 00:00:35,200
Director Ma had Laizi

5
00:00:35,259 --> 00:00:36,780
throw all your stuff out.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,840
Seriously...

7
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,979
Mengmeng, where are you going?

8
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:55,140
Did you throw out all of Zhou Meng's stuff?

9
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,420
Don't worry.

10
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:57,640
You think I can't handle a simple thing like this?

11
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:58,460
Good.

12
00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:00,439
She doesn't know what's good for her.

13
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,020
She brought this all on herself.

14
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:05,400
Ma Limin!

15
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:10,959
What do you think you're doing?

16
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,500
I'm a worker at this factory,

17
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:15,400
a permanent driver in the transport team!

18
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,780
I earn my living by my skills!

19
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,359
What right do you have to kick me out of the dorm?

20
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,180
What right do you have to ban me from the factory?

21
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,099
Zhou Meng,

22
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:24,680
the severe consequences

23
00:01:24,739 --> 00:01:25,819
your actions brought upon the factory...

24
00:01:25,859 --> 00:01:26,760
Aren't you aware of them yourself?

25
00:01:27,159 --> 00:01:28,939
Stealing what you're supposed to guard makes you a thief.

26
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:31,439
The factory didn't send you to prison,

27
00:01:32,219 --> 00:01:33,959
and just told you to pack your bags and get lost.

28
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:36,019
That is already more than generous!

29
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,599
Let me tell you,

30
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,579
I broke no laws!

31
00:01:42,939 --> 00:01:44,219
Even the police didn't press charges!

32
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:45,540
What right do you have—

33
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:49,480
You really want me to spell it out, don't you?

34
00:01:50,659 --> 00:01:51,819
A young woman like you,

35
00:01:52,659 --> 00:01:53,680
acting completely shameless,

36
00:01:54,099 --> 00:01:55,879
guarding the warehouse alone with a man,

37
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,340
and disappearing all night long!

38
00:01:57,939 --> 00:01:58,620
What did you go off and do?

39
00:01:59,299 --> 00:02:01,340
Did you do something to honor your ancestors,

40
00:02:01,579 --> 00:02:02,819
or to bring glory to yourself?

41
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:05,620
Do you have any decency left?

42
00:02:12,159 --> 00:02:13,120
Have you no shame?

43
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,520
Do you really want me to spell it out?

44
00:02:17,919 --> 00:02:20,280
You didn't get your filthy way with me,

45
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:23,620
so now you're trying to ruin my life!

46
00:02:24,979 --> 00:02:25,960
What are you talking about?

47
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,439
Do you have any proof?

48
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:31,020
If not, that's slander and defamation!

49
00:02:31,419 --> 00:02:32,780
You'll get hauled right back to the police station!

50
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:35,620
Fine, I'm not going to argue with you.

51
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,400
This shipyard is too small

52
00:02:37,580 --> 00:02:38,740
for someone as high-and-mighty as you.

53
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:41,080
I'm officially notifying you right now.

54
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:42,879
You,

55
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,060
Zhou Meng...

56
00:02:45,659 --> 00:02:46,460
You're fired!

57
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:34,500
Stop playing innocent!

58
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,539
Just be with me! What're you doing?

59
00:03:35,699 --> 00:03:36,560
Let go of me! Zhou Meng!

60
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,400
Zhou Meng!

61
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:38,120
Zhou Meng!

62
00:03:38,460 --> 00:03:39,139
Ma Limin.

63
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,919
If you won't behave yourself, I'll make you.

64
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,620
Progress is still a bit slow.

65
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,180
We need to pick up the pace for the next phase.

66
00:04:42,519 --> 00:04:43,139
Fellow workers!

67
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,939
I'm a driver from the transport team,

68
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:46,939
Zhou Meng.

69
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:48,699
Zhou Meng?

70
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,939
Today, I'm going to expose someone.

71
00:04:52,899 --> 00:04:54,819
A hypocritical beast in human clothing:

72
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,120
Ma Limin!

73
00:04:57,139 --> 00:04:58,860
Relying on his position as deputy director,

74
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,980
he's abused his power for years,

75
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:03,120
to dock workers' benefits,

76
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,160
taking bribes and shakedowns, and extorting kickbacks!

77
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,839
He's even targeted the female workers,

78
00:05:09,379 --> 00:05:10,279
groping them,

79
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,060
repeatedly harassing them,

80
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,279
and forcing himself on them!

81
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,079
To all the sisters he's wronged:

82
00:05:17,819 --> 00:05:19,079
I know you're too afraid to speak up.

83
00:05:20,339 --> 00:05:21,360
But I'll speak up for you!

84
00:05:22,379 --> 00:05:23,680
The sky over our factory

85
00:05:24,399 --> 00:05:25,399
shouldn't be this dark,

86
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,560
or this filthy!

87
00:05:27,860 --> 00:05:29,920
All the vile, dirty things Ma Limin has done,

88
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:31,540
so many of us already know about them.

89
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,759
Yet all of you, just like me,

90
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,040
didn't dare say a word.

91
00:05:36,939 --> 00:05:37,579
Because we were scared.

92
00:05:38,139 --> 00:05:39,120
Scared of losing our jobs,

93
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,379
scared of being targeted,

94
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,560
and scared our families

95
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:44,100
would have no way to survive!

96
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:47,620
That's why Ma Limin dared to act all-powerful,

97
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:50,420
treating us workers like dirt,

98
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:52,620
and stuffing state property

99
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:53,920
straight into his own pockets!

100
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,379
I'm standing here saying this today,

101
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,220
not because I'm so brave.

102
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,579
It's because I realized

103
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:07,639
that suffering in silence changes nothing!

104
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:09,500
Ma Limin!

105
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:12,879
Did you really think you were untouchable?

106
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:15,980
Did you really think no one would dare fight back?

107
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:17,319
You're dead wrong!

108
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:20,959
Every single word I speak from now on,

109
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:23,160
I will take full responsibility for!

110
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:25,540
Deputy Director Ma

111
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,540
tried to force me into dating him.

112
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:32,439
When I refused,

113
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:36,740
he tried to molest me over and over!

114
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:38,879
"But you're also my employee.

115
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:40,060
Just trying to build some rapport.

116
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,420
Got quite a sharp tongue, huh?

117
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:43,060
Zhou Meng, quit playing innocent!

118
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:44,060
Just be with me! What're you doing?"

119
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,920
What's happening to me now

120
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,420
has happened to other sisters before,

121
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:52,540
and it could happen to any of you!

122
00:06:53,779 --> 00:06:55,519
We can't just stand by and do nothing!

123
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,639
Everything I know,

124
00:06:58,959 --> 00:06:59,560
everything I've seen,

125
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,139
and all the evidence I've gathered,

126
00:07:02,699 --> 00:07:03,639
I will send to the authorities!

127
00:07:04,759 --> 00:07:05,379
Comrades!

128
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:07,540
Fellow workers!

129
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:10,079
We are the true masters of this factory!

130
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,439
One voice might be quiet.

131
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,759
One person might be pushed around.

132
00:07:18,939 --> 00:07:20,560
But if we speak out together,

133
00:07:21,779 --> 00:07:24,000
our voices can tear through the roof!

134
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,759
We can win back our justice!

135
00:07:27,379 --> 00:07:28,819
That damn bitch!

136
00:07:30,019 --> 00:07:30,439
Uncle!

137
00:07:30,959 --> 00:07:31,339
Uncle!

138
00:07:37,779 --> 00:07:38,560
Ma Limin!

139
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:39,839
I'll kill you!

140
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:40,959
Liu Haizhu!

141
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:42,939
Hold them off for me!

142
00:07:42,939 --> 00:07:43,560
Get the hell out!

143
00:07:45,899 --> 00:07:46,319
Liu Haizhu!

144
00:07:49,899 --> 00:07:50,379
Liu Haizhu!

145
00:07:53,819 --> 00:07:54,939
Are you crazy?!

146
00:07:55,899 --> 00:07:57,699
Liu Haizhu! Liu Haizhu!

147
00:08:08,019 --> 00:08:09,680
Liu Haizhu, stop!

148
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:12,480
Liu Haizhu, you're gonna kill someone!

149
00:08:15,980 --> 00:08:16,899
Liu Haizhu, you...

150
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,579
Take it easy, Liu Haizhu! Liu Haizhu!

151
00:08:21,339 --> 00:08:23,579
Liu Haizhu, are you crazy?!

152
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,819
Stop it!

153
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:25,879
I'm begging you!

154
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:27,079
Stop, Liu Haizhu!

155
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,180
You've lost your mind!

156
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:01,440
Uncle!

157
00:10:02,059 --> 00:10:02,480
Uncle!

158
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,539
Call the Security Section! Someone's gonna get killed!

159
00:10:09,139 --> 00:10:09,620
Uncle!

160
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,759
Report and expose him!

161
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,019
Ma Limin abused his power for personal gain!

162
00:10:15,539 --> 00:10:16,399
I'm reporting him!

163
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:18,759
Ma Limin skimmed off supplies!

164
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:19,980
I'm reporting him!

165
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,860
I want to report him too!

166
00:10:22,059 --> 00:10:25,580
I'm reporting him too! Me too!

167
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:37,919
Report him! Report him! Report him!

168
00:12:40,539 --> 00:12:41,000
Here.

169
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,039
Eat something.

170
00:12:42,259 --> 00:12:42,919
You must be starving.

171
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:47,779
Dad...

172
00:12:49,820 --> 00:12:50,480
I'm...

173
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:53,019
I'm sorry.

174
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:57,460
Uncle...

175
00:12:58,620 --> 00:12:59,299
I'm sorry.

176
00:13:00,659 --> 00:13:02,320
I'm the one who dragged Haizhu into this.

177
00:13:07,379 --> 00:13:07,879
It's alright.

178
00:13:09,659 --> 00:13:11,259
Life still has to go on.

179
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,679
Once you're full,

180
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,080
go over to Aunt Cai's

181
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:17,620
and get some good sleep.

182
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,639
I understand.

183
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:28,580
You're both good kids.

184
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:47,440
Eat up.

185
00:14:44,779 --> 00:14:45,759
Why aren't you asleep yet?

186
00:14:48,019 --> 00:14:49,179
I can't sleep.

187
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,580
Why are you still up?

188
00:14:59,379 --> 00:15:00,320
I figured,

189
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,139
I can't do much else,

190
00:15:03,639 --> 00:15:04,879
so I'd make these little trinkets.

191
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:08,820
Maybe they can bring in some cash.

192
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:14,980
I still want to go to Shanghai soon to propose.

193
00:15:25,159 --> 00:15:26,539
You must not have slept well these past few days.

194
00:15:27,659 --> 00:15:28,500
You should go back and get some sleep.

195
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:44,299
Zhou Meng.

196
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:52,419
What are you doing here?
